# Binary deliverables (pitch decks, exported reports). Kept in OneDrive, where
# co-editing works - git cannot diff them and would store a fresh copy per edit.
*.pptx
*.docx

# Source spreadsheets. The GIZ download is 1.4 MB of binary that git cannot
# diff, and it is re-downloadable from CKAN. The CSV the loader produces IS
# committed, so nobody else needs Excel or the original file.
*.xlsx
*.xls
